        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mario Mandžukić\n- Organizations: Croatia national team, VfL Wolfsburg, Bayern Munich\n- Places: Italy, Croatia\n- Events: 1986–87 2. Bundesliga season, 2013 UEFA Super Cup\n- Topics: football transfers, club records\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1986–87 season, VfL Wolfsburg set two 2. Bundesliga records.\n- Bayern Munich competed in the 2013 UEFA Super Cup as the UEFA Champions League winner.\n- Mario Mandžukić is a Croatian professional footballer.\n- Mario Mandžukić plays for an Italian club and for the Croatia national team.\n- Mario Mandžukić was signed by VfL Wolfsburg.\n- The 2. Bundesliga records that VfL Wolfsburg set in 1986–87 were not repeated until the season when Mario Mandžukić was signed by VfL Wolfsburg.",
